msgstr "Peace signed — every weapon aimed at that country falls silent, strikes on other enemies go on; the war no longer flares up again by itself"

msgid "Боты активнее в воздухе — чаще наносят удары ракетами и дронами"
msgstr "Bots are more active in the air — they strike with missiles and drones more often"

